<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>重庆鸡公煲酱料 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.talk{padding:10px 14px;background:#fef9f2;border-radius:10px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8}
.alert{font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;padding:6px 0 0 0;font-style:italic}
.tip-item{padding:8px 12px;background:#fef9f2;border-left:3px solid #C0392B;border-radius:4px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.6}
.ing-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}
.ing-table th{text-align:left;padding:6px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd4ca;color:#3a322a;font-weight:600;font-size:11px}
.ing-table td{padding:5px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f0ea;color:#5a4f44}
.ing-table .cat{font-weight:600;color:#3a322a;background:#f8f4ef}
.paywall{padding:24px 22px;text-align:center;background:#fdf8f0}
.paywall .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#C0392B}
.paywall .desc{font-size:13px;color:#7a7269;margin:8px 0 16px;line-height:1.6}
.paywall .btn{display:inline-block;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:10px 32px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}
.paywall .btn:hover{background:#a33025}
.paywall .up{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:10px}
.free-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
.lock-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">咔库秘制 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>重庆鸡公煲酱料</h1>
  <div class="sub">海鲜酱柱候酱打底 · 香料复合 · 一酱一锅</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#酱料配方</span><span>#鸡公煲</span><span>#商用</span><span>#酱焖</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 酱料配方</span>
  <span class="level-item">一锅出6-8份</span>
  <span class="level-item">毛利70-80%</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">
    鸡公煲不是"炒鸡"，是"酱焖鸡"。酱料决定一切。<br><br>
    海鲜酱+柱候酱+甜面酱+芝麻酱+花生酱+番茄酱——六酱合一，咸甜酸鲜全齐。香料小茴香、香叶、桂皮、八角、白蔻、丁香、山楂、香茅草、草果、香砂仁打粉提香，郫县豆瓣酱给红油底子，鸡肉浸膏+乙基麦芽酚拉肉感。<br><br>
    一勺酱焖一锅鸡，鸡肉200-300g配土豆洋葱，酱汁包裹挂满，出餐快利润厚。一份成本约¥5-6，卖¥25-35，毛利70%+。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 📋 原料清单（一锅6-8份）</div>
  <table class="ing-table">
    <tr><th>类别</th><th>原料</th><th style="text-align:right">用量</th></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="11">香料粉</td><td>小茴香</td><td style="text-align:right">1g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>桂皮</td><td style="text-align:right">1.2g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>八角</td><td style="text-align:right">0.8g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>山楂</td><td style="text-align:right">0.8g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>草果</td><td style="text-align:right">0.6g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>白蔻</td><td style="text-align:right">0.5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>香叶</td><td style="text-align:right">0.5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>香砂仁</td><td style="text-align:right">0.5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>丁香</td><td style="text-align:right">0.3g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>香茅草</td><td style="text-align:right">0.3g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>干红辣椒</td><td style="text-align:right">适量</td></tr>
    <tr><td>花椒</td><td style="text-align:right">适量</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="2">底料</td><td>郫县豆瓣酱（切碎）</td><td style="text-align:right">50g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>洋葱片</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="2">油脂</td><td>色拉油</td><td style="text-align:right">300g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>鸡化油</td><td style="text-align:right">少许</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="11">秘制酱料</td><td>生抽</td><td style="text-align:right">60g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>料酒</td><td style="text-align:right">30g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>海鲜酱</td><td style="text-align:right">20g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>番茄酱</td><td style="text-align:right">20g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>特鲜一号</td><td style="text-align:right">15g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>味精</td><td style="text-align:right">15g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>芝麻酱</td><td style="text-align:right">15g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>甜面酱</td><td style="text-align:right">8g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>柱候酱</td><td style="text-align:right">7g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>花生酱</td><td style="text-align:right">7g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>鸡精</td><td style="text-align:right">5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="cat" rowspan="4">增香</td><td>鸡肉浸膏</td><td style="text-align:right">5g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>沙姜粉</td><td style="text-align:right">2g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>胡椒粉</td><td style="text-align:right">1g</td></tr>
    <tr><td>乙基麦芽酚</td><td style="text-align:right">0.5g</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:6px">一锅酱料约540g，配鸡肉1.2-1.8kg+配菜。香料可批量打成粉存放。</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 💰 成本参考</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>单份酱料成本</span><span class="v">约¥1.5-2.5</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>+鸡肉+配菜总成本</span><span class="v">约¥5-6</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>建议售价</span><span class="v">¥25-35/份</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🔧 做法</div>
  <div class="launch" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    <span>① 香料全部打成细粉备用</span>
    <span>② 色拉油+鸡化油烧热，下洋葱片炸香</span>
    <span>③ 下郫县豆瓣酱，小火炒出红油</span>
    <span>④ 下香料粉炒香</span>
    <span>⑤ 下所有酱料（海鲜酱、柱候酱、甜面酱、芝麻酱、花生酱、番茄酱）炒匀</span>
    <span>⑥ 下生抽、料酒、特鲜一号、味精、鸡精、沙姜粉、胡椒粉</span>
    <span>⑦ 下鸡肉浸膏、乙基麦芽酚，炒匀出锅</span>
    <br>
    <span><strong>出餐：</strong></span>
    <span>⑧ 鸡肉切块，加酱料腌制10min</span>
    <span>⑨ 锅烧热加油，下鸡肉炒变色，加土豆洋葱青椒</span>
    <span>⑩ 加少量高汤焖8-10min，出锅</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title"><span class="free-badge">免费</span> 🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 香料要打成粉——整颗香料在酱里分布不均，有的鸡肉块有香味有的没有。打成粉才能均匀挂住。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 豆瓣酱必须炒出红油——生豆瓣味重，小火慢炒到油变红、酱变香才能进行下一步。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 乙基麦芽酚和鸡肉浸膏别省——这是拉"肉感"的关键，没有这两样酱料吃起来像素酱。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 酱料不要一次炒太多——酱里有多种酱和油，放久了风味有变化。建议一次炒3-5天的量。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 鸡肉要先腌后炒——酱料直接下锅炒不入味。鸡肉切块后用酱料腌10min，味道才能渗进去。</div>
</div>


</div>
</body>
</html>
